          str (4:5:15-4:5:15) text="q"
````

A thematic break ends where the next line starts; code blocks and divs end on their closing fence.
```` ap
para

***

```zig
code
```

::: warn
inner
:::
.
doc
  para (1:1:0-2:0:4)
    str (1:1:0-1:4:3) text="para"
  thematic_break (3:1:6-4:0:9)
  code_block (5:1:11-7:3:25) text="code\n" lang="zig"
  div (9:1:28-11:3:45) class="warn"
    para (10:1:37-11:0:42)
      str (10:1:37-10:5:41) text="inner"
````

An unclosed code block ends at the end of the input.
```` ap
```
open
.
doc
  code_block (1:1:0-3:0:8) text="open\n"
````

Tilde fences; a list closed by a div's fence ends past the fence, its item on the fence.
