  block_quote (1:1:0-4:0:19)
    heading (2:3:9-4:0:19) level=1 id="h"
      str (2:5:11-2:5:11) text="H"
      soft_break (3:0:12-3:0:12)
      str (3:3:15-3:6:18) text="more"
````

A section starts at its heading and ends at the end of the document.
