        row (3:3:7-4:0:12) head=true
          cell (3:3:7-3:7:11) head=true align="default"
            str (3:5:9-3:5:9) text="x"
  para (6:1:22-7:0:26)
    str (6:1:22-6:4:25) text="para"
````

A list inside a div closed by its fence: the item ends on the fence.
```` ap
::: d
- a
  > q
:::
.
