        str (1:3:2-1:3:2) text="a"
    row (3:1:14-4:0:19) head=false
      cell (3:1:14-3:5:18) head=false align="default"
        str (3:3:16-3:3:16) text="1"
````

A row needs no spaces around its pipes.
```` ap
|a|
.
