  table (1:1:0-2:0:3)
    caption
    row (1:1:0-2:0:3) head=false
      cell (1:1:0-1:3:2) head=false align="default"
        str (1:2:1-1:2:1) text="a"
````

A row without a closing pipe ends the table where it starts.
```` ap
| a |
| b
.
doc
  table (1:1:0-2:1:6)
    caption
    row (1:1:0-2:0:5) head=false
      cell (1:1:0-1:5:4) head=false align="default"
        str (1:3:2-1:3:2) text="a"
  para (2:1:6-3:0:9)
    str (2:1:6-2:3:8) text="| b"
````

