<li>
<input disabled="" type="checkbox"/>
more
</li>
</ul>
````

A backslash ending a paragraph is a hard break on the newline; the paragraph ends there at the end of the input.
```` ap
a\
.
doc
  para (1:1:0-2:0:2)
    str (1:1:0-1:1:0) text="a"
    hard_break (2:0:2-2:0:2)
````

A paragraph ending in a hard break ends one past it: on the following blank line's newline.
```` ap
a\

b
.
doc
  para (1:1:0-3:0:3)
    str (1:1:0-1:1:0) text="a"
    hard_break (2:0:2-2:0:2)
  para (3:1:4-4:0:5)
    str (3:1:4-3:1:4) text="b"
````

A backslash ending a list item's paragraph.
```` ap
- a\
.
