        hard_break (2:0:4-2:0:4)
    list_item (3:1:6-4:0:9)
      para (3:3:8-4:0:9)
        str (3:3:8-3:3:8) text="b"
````

A paragraph ending in a hard break before a closing fence ends on the fence's first byte.
