````

A hard break followed by a continuation line.
```` ap
- a\
   - b
.
doc
  bullet_list (1:1:0-3:0:11) tight=true style="-"
    list_item (1:1:0-3:0:11)
      para (1:3:2-3:0:11)
        str (1:3:2-1:3:2) text="a"
        hard_break (2:0:4-2:0:4)
